# AMS Builds — no environment variables or secrets are required.
#
# Production: Cloudflare Workers + the CmsSite Durable Object configured in
# wrangler.jsonc. Content, settings, photos and admin sessions are shared by
# every visitor and are visible immediately after each admin save.
#
# Local development: `npm run dev` uses the file-backed .dev-cms/ directory.
# Production preview: `npm run preview` builds and starts wrangler dev.
